ção não foca. Garantia: 90 dias do Fabricante.', 149.9, 149.9, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Lighting', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rdwz-mdn98ijd3kga7b', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1362877346%2F23793393890', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
