igo do Fabricante 146STP8M200H Quantidade de Dentes 147', 70.11, 70.11, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Engine', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rblq-lluc6jhf5mar48', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F817551928%2F19261791694', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
