seu rosto. Rolo suavemente com as mãos levemente regadas e enxágue abundantemente com água morna Após dissolver a maquiagem e o sebo, enxágue suavemente com as mãos levemente regadas e enxágue abundantemente com água morna. O óleo que absorveu o desperdício da pele é lavado somente quando é umedecido com água e passa por um processo de emulsificação. Após a lavagem suave da água, lave bem com água para não deixar resíduos. Capacidade do produto] [Capacidade do produto] 240g [Opções] Óleo de limpeza de limpeza 240ml #Good Preço #Good Qualidade de qualidade #Korean Cosméticos #KBeleza ————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ♡Três promessas de koksara.kbeauty 1.Conduzimos desinfecção três vezes por semana.√ 2.Vendemos 100% genuíno.√ 3.Tempo de carregamento: Todo o tempo [24/7].√ needly mild deep cleansing oil 240ml shipping from korea Product Information 🩵 A refreshing cleansing oil that even oily skin can use. The ingredients are gentle and help clean blackheads and skin impurities. Light and watery texture. 🩵 Contains camellia seed oil with bio-emulsification technology. Helps instantly improve blackheads. No synthetic dyes or synthetic fragrances. Deep cleanse the impurities and dead skin cells accumulated in the pores due to the external environment. 🩵 Sebum and blackheads, do not pull them out, but dissolve them. After applying cleansing oil, moisten it with water and roll it for a more thorough cleansing. 🩵 The finer and lighter the oil particles are, the more they can be absorbed into every nook and cranny of the pores, quickly and effectively dissolving unnecessary sebum. Needly Mild Deep Cleansing Oil contains small particle oils that act as natural surfactants obtained through patented fermentation technology. Ingredients: Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Solves-30 Tetraoleate, Triethylhexanoin, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Olive Oil, Camellia Seed Oil, Candida Bombicholae/Glu-Cose/Methyl Lape Catedate Fermented products, argan kernel oil, green tea seed oil, coconut palm oil, sunflower seed oil, rice bran oil, jojoba seed oil, grape seed oil, fragrant oil, rosemary leaf oil, caprylyl glycol, ethylhexyl glycerin, soap leaf extract , purified water, butylene glycol, 1,2-hexanediol [How to use] Take an appropriate amount of the contents in dry hands and gently massage your face. After dissolving makeup and sebum, gently roll with slightly watered hands and rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. The oil that has absorbed skin waste is washed away only when it is moistened with water and goes through an emulsification process. After gently rolling, rinse thoroughly with water to leave no residue. [Product capacity] 240g [Options] cleansing oil 240ml #Good Price #Good Quality #Korean Cosmetics #K-Beauty ————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ♡Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√', 225.0, 180.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Makeup > Makeup Removers', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rbnd-lm5ed0bc4g053b', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F22892470143', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
