l used in actual professional care. It tightens sagging and loose pores without any gaps. Pore care that is directly inserted with a sharp shot that is 25 times smaller than the pore Contains the largest number of exosomes ever, over 20 million Maintains pore elasticity for 7 days even if used only once a week [How to use] After washing your face in the evening every 7 days, apply an appropriate amount to your bare face, excluding the area around your eyes and mouth, and rub it in for absorption. After absorption is complete, apply a moisturizing formula to finish. (*Be sure to read the directions carefully before using this ampoule, which has effective stimulation. Each person may have different effects.) [Product capacity] 13ml #Korean cosmetics #K-beauty #good product #good price ————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ❤Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√', 322.0, 188.5, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Facial Serum & Essence', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rdym-mciqqykfwi47ad', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F26638947405', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
